# Closed references by name are no error (the author 2026-11-11, LMX_blog/2026-11-11.md#known-name-not-expanded; plan
# M11 5a): A holds the atom B and B holds the atom A. Nothing is expanded, so both stay as written and nothing loops; A
# has one field.
# The root variant of closed_names, kept after plan M11 5v on purpose: A and B are declared at the root of the unit, so
# the root route of declarations stays under a fixture until plan M11 5g replaces that route (R26, item 9).
A: B
B: A
int: seen length(A)
